<title>INDIA: TABLE-India April crude output rises to 2.80 mln T.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India April crude output rises to 2.80 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's crude petroleum output rose to 2.80 million tonnes in April from 2.75 million in the same month in 1996, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    PETROLEUM OUTPUT	April    April    Apr-Mar   Apr-Mar</p>
<p>				   1997     1996    1996/97   1995/96</p>
<p>    Crude		   2,802.0  2,754.0   31,541.0  34,517.0</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products  5,216.0  5,124.0   62,814.0  58,741.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes unless stated and preliminary. Figures for petroleum products relate to throughput.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
